The named updater identity contract in docs/architecture/appliance/builder.md
states: "The updater token stays unchanged in the image configuration."
Keep that password raw in Update.HTTPPassword.
Parse the credential-free destination first, then assign net/url.UserPassword.
Reserved password bytes therefore cannot alter the URL authority or path,
and destination parse errors never include the password.

Design: docs/architecture/appliance/builder.md, named updater identity.

